  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Sashastra Seema Bal (SSB)</a>&nbsp;</span>has released the Written Exam Date for the post of Head Constable (Ministerial). This recruitment was released for 115 posts. Applications for the SSB Head Constable Ministerial Recruitment 2021 were accepted from July 24, 2021, to August 28, 2021. The written examination is going to be started on 07 July 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their SSB Head Constable Ministerial Written Exam Date 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Sashastra Seema Bal (SSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSB Head Constable Ministerial Written Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No. : 338/RC/SSB/HC(Min)/2020</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 July 2021</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>28 Augus